human behavior, as opposed to things that you measure out

11
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:43,160
in space or test tubes or under microscopes.

12
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:46,480
People are complex organisms, right?

13
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:49,480
And to do research on them, to understand human nature, how

14
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,840
the mind works, how the brain supports it, is a

15
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:52,960
challenging story.

16
