136
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:17,840
So that's coming in your lifetime, because there's

137
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:21,040
steady progress on this, and how to think about that is a

138
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,840
really big question.

139
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:26,640
So I'm going to talk with you today about research and

