00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:13,120
interesting, and then some topics related to psychology.

216
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,280
So let me start with this.

217
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:16,720
How do you know what is true?

218
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:19,120
How do you know what is true?

219
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,480
That you take to be true?

220
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:25,920
What is the answer?

221
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,280
Everyone's looking all like, how do I know?

222
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,000
Please tell me.

223
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:28,960
OK.

224
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:31,240
Well, when people try to analyze this, and you can think

